 <p style="font-size:14px;color:#e5e5e5;line-height:1.6;margin:0;"><strong style="color:#fff;">The constraint:</strong> Leadership teams waste 20+ hours weekly on manual competitive research that arrives too late to matter. <strong style="color:#fff;">The decision:</strong> Serverless RAG pipeline with no idle infrastructure cost, elastic scale, and frontier model reasoning on public web data. <strong style="color:#fff;">The result:</strong> Real-time intelligence alerts that replace the analyst's Monday morning summary.</p>
