 <p style="font-size:14px;color:#e5e5e5;line-height:1.6;margin:0;"><strong style="color:#fff;">The constraint:</strong> AI pipelines fail in enterprise contexts without proper isolation, authentication, and auditability. <strong style="color:#fff;">The decision:</strong> Build a full-stack multi-tenant backend using FastAPI, Supabase, and PostgreSQL RLS, not just a script. <strong style="color:#fff;">The result:</strong> A production-grade SaaS platform a compliance officer can approve on day one.</p>
