 <h4 class="text-xs font-mono text-teal-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Governance Layer</h4>
 <p class="text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">RLS policies are defined per table and enforced at the PostgreSQL level. A misconfigured application route cannot leak tenant data. Audit logging captures every run, stage result, and QC outcome. Role-based access means a viewer can't trigger a pipeline run. A tenant_admin can't touch another tenant's data. Enterprise controls, not application-level trust.</p>
