 <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mt-2">The Platforms That Had to Work</h2>
 <p class="text-neutral-400 max-w-2xl mt-2">Before the agents, there were the platforms. High-stakes data environments where governance wasn't a preference and failure wasn't an option - and where I learned exactly what AI systems depend on to survive contact with reality.</p>
 </div>
 <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-10">
